  "description": "<p>Touch; one object or a <strong>10ft cube</strong> per level.</p><ul><li>Choose a kind of creature (a species, or an alignment); that kind within <strong>30ft</strong> must make a <strong>Will save</strong> each round or be <strong>Frightened</strong> and move away; the effect lasts <strong>1 hour per level</strong>.</li><li>A creature that succeeds is immune for <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li><li>Cast reversed (Sympathy): the chosen kind within <strong>60ft</strong> must make a <strong>Will save</strong> or be drawn to the spot and stay within <strong>10ft</strong> of it (no attacks on the object); <strong>Will negates</strong>.</li></ul><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Reversible:</strong> may be cast as its opposite with the same slot.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Wizard, Cleric, Druid, Witch</p>",
